## Concrete parallel opportunities and deliberate joins

- After the durable model is verified, local frames, tiny-document hosting and Agent operation adapters may proceed independently, provided they consume the fixed acceptance API.
- After shared local assets/navigation/mesh foundations, geography, exact CAD, supplied character work, functional devices and imported-base work can branch. Structural molecule editing can begin from the earlier frame/selection/asset export. Operational table workflows need the authority/query branch, not 3D coverage.
- Character rigs need the shared geometric joint service and simplification; they do not wait for exact-solid CAD, globe/city coverage or Gaussian-splat integration. Anatomy/annotation and authored motion may proceed separately after the rig boundary. Full character acceptance joins both and the relevant Agent/hosting exports. A final geographic avatar journey remains required at core acceptance, without delaying local character construction.
- Schematic authoring precedes PCB realization. PCB work needs exact geometry and takeoff; reusable device integration joins the board and functional models. Numerical circuit foundations can use a standalone schematic; the full powered-device demonstration joins its real PCB/functional mapping.
- Empirical material selection has no circuit prerequisite. A real first circuit calculation proves shared numerical jobs; independent laboratory and rigid-body adapters can then consume those services. Live numerical transitions wait for a validated detailed/equivalent pair; mechanical and thermal state maps still require their own proofs. Circuit adaptive policy does not block unrelated methods that only need the earlier verified runtime.
- Keep exact CAD/kernel extensions under one owner, shared continuum elasticity/thermal work under one owner, and broad manufacturing/civil or chemical/living subfamilies grouped until actual independent boundaries are demonstrated. Do not invent extra parallel strands simply because their subject names differ.
- Full hosted-world, character, electronic-device, scientific-adoption, infrastructure and core acceptance are explicit joins. They wait for their contributors; independent implementation does not wait for unrelated joins.

